        <p>China-US deep discussion on AI governance with US switching to "superintelligence" terminology; Anthropic negotiating 1GW data center deal; global AI infrastructure driving Chinese battery orders; large model price war continues as Zhipu valuation drops to $300B HKD. AI competition extends from model layer to computing infrastructure and energy supply chain.</p>
